# Worktrees where bash-write-guard.py stands down.
#
# One absolute path per line. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
# An entry only takes effect if the path is a real linked git worktree, so
# naming a main checkout here does nothing.
#
# Empty file = guard active everywhere (the safe default).
#
# Example:
#   /home/you/work/scratch-checkout
